    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sefirot lives through eight lifetimes, carrying the full weight of her memories from one to the next.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dayflies, born to live only a single day, leave their memories written on leaves, hoping the next will read and remember.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>At the grave of her beloved, now gone after his eighth and final life, Sefirot meets a dayfly. She agrees to help her find the scattered leaves that hold the forgotten stories of her kind.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Day in a Life of a Dayfly\u00a0\u2014\u00a0<i>a visual novel that came from nowhere but was made with love.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd8b Unique\u00a0artwork \u2014 a blend of illustrations and photography.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf43 Original music (menu theme).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How to Play:</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf43 Check each character\u2019s \u201cStatus\u201d tab in the menu and examine the memory leaves in your inventory to better understand their inner world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd8b Unlock two endings based on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sefirot lives through eight lifetimes, carrying the full weight of her memories from one to the next.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dayflies, born to live only a single day, leave their memories written on leaves, hoping the next will read and remember.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>At the grave of her beloved, now gone after his eighth and final life, Sefirot meets a dayfly. She agrees to help her find the scattered leaves that hold the forgotten stories of her kind.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Day in a Life of a Dayfly\u00a0\u2014\u00a0<i>a visual novel that came from nowhere but was made with love.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd8b Unique\u00a0artwork \u2014 a blend of illustrations and photography.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf43 Original music (menu theme).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How to Play:</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf43 Check each character\u2019s \u201cStatus\u201d tab in the menu and examine the memory leaves in your inventory to better understand their inner world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd8b Unlock two endings based on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
